{"segment_id": "segment_00010", "start": 300.0, "end": 330.0, "speech": "去把文章复述一遍。第一个单元有很多我做的示范啊，在这里就不一一示范了。OK，呃，summary writing练习我们写作复述的能力。然后呢，到这里各位写完啊，在文章当中先去看题，我们教材当中先看题，看完题来这儿对答案就可以了。这是参考答案啊，不是唯一正确答案。接下来呢，topic for discussion，我们老习惯只说题目翻译啊，各位感兴趣可以自己开始做了。So how much do you", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000038.webp", "time": 307.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Summary writing: Key", "训练目标：", "写作复述能力"], "scores": [0.99925, 0.95471, 0.99986], "boxes": [[[54.0, 132.0], [568.0, 139.0], [567.0, 203.0], [53.0, 195.0]], [[108.0, 333.0], [341.0, 333.0], [341.0, 394.0], [108.0, 394.0]], [[108.0, 396.0], [415.0, 396.0], [415.0, 460.0], [108.0, 460.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000039.webp", "time": 311.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Summary writing: Key", "•When the Hubble telescope was launched", "into space in April 1990, the pictures it sent", "us were very disappointing because the", "main mirror was faulty.", "•Four astronauts will soon be making the", "necessary repairs, and eventually, pictures", "from the Hubble will tell us a great deal", "about the age and size of the universe."], "scores": [0.99119, 0.97227, 0.98008, 0.98753, 0.99234, 0.96643, 0.97104, 0.97049, 0.98715], "boxes": [[[53.0, 131.0], [566.0, 136.0], [566.0, 203.0], [53.0, 197.0]], [[110.0, 331.0], [1106.0, 331.0], [1106.0, 393.0], [110.0, 393.0]], [[103.0, 394.0], [1104.0, 392.0], [1104.0, 457.0], [103.0, 459.0]], [[102.0, 459.0], [1023.0, 454.0], [1023.0, 516.0], [102.0, 521.0]], [[105.0, 512.0], [626.0, 518.0], [625.0, 581.0], [104.0, 575.0]], [[107.0, 575.0], [1048.0, 575.0], [1048.0, 643.0], [107.0, 643.0]], [[104.0, 641.0], [1073.0, 641.0], [1073.0, 703.0], [104.0, 703.0]], [[103.0, 696.0], [1012.0, 699.0], [1012.0, 764.0], [103.0, 761.0]], [[107.0, 758.0], [1003.0, 763.0], [1003.0, 826.0], [107.0, 821.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000040.webp", "time": 321.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Topics for discussion", "训练目标：", "完全自由的对话", "Accuracy", "Fluency"], "scores": [0.99803, 0.96626, 0.99955, 0.99883, 0.99935], "boxe